[I] Utilities for various operations on SATA, SAS, NVMe and USB storage devices

[T] openSeaChest is a collection of comprehensive, easy-to-use command line
[T] diagnostic tools and programming libraries for storage devices that help
[T] you quickly determine the health and status of your storage product.

